# Keep frozen artifacts byte-stable across platforms.
# Store every file as-is (no line-ending conversion / no text normalisation),
# EXCEPT summary.csv, which csv.writer emits with CRLF on every platform.
# Without unifying it to LF, re-running summarize.py on Linux would show the
# file as spuriously modified. See PUBLISH.md (2026-09-27 note).
* -text
summary.csv text eol=lf
